    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Effective August 1, 1977\nsiXIRE\nFLIGHT TIMES\nFeaturing connecting or commuting\nservice to 11 California cities, with\nnew direct flights between Fresno\nand San Jose.\n• San Francisco\n• San Jose\nLos Angeles\nSan Luis Obispo\n/ Santa Maria\nPaso Robles\nSacramento\nFresno\nBakersfield\nVisalia\nModesto\nNOW FLYING... 29-PASSENGER NORD\n262 PROP-JETS ON SELECTED ROUTES",
      "REDDING\nSACRAMENTO\nMODESTO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nSWIFE\nSystem\nMap\nSAN JOSE\nFRESNO\nPASO\nROBLES\nVISALIA\nSAN LUIS OBISPO\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA MARIA\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nI ROUTES PENDING\nJOINT FARES PLAN\nYou can fly Swift Aire free, or at greatly reduced fares,\nwhen you connect on other airlines for flights to many\nlocations in the U.S.\nSWIFT AIRE AND AVIS\nRent a fine Avis car at destinations served by Swift Aire.\nSwift Aire and Avis, getting together to serve you better.\nFor Reservations and Flight\nInformation, Call Toll Free\n800/592-5900\nIn San Luis Obispo.\nIn Santa Maria_\nIn Paso Robles-\n-544-4677\n925-0987\n238-5700"
    ],
